/-!
# `base16ct` specification

Entry point for the specification of the `base16ct` crate:

* `Base16ct.Spec.Base16`: the crate's decoders, errors and length rules, built on RFC 4648 in
  `Standards.RFC.BaseEncodings`, which it imports;
* `Base16ct.Spec.Program.Extracted`: the compiled program, generated by `scripts/extract.py`;
* `Base16ct.Spec.Program`: call semantics of each extracted entry point.

`Base16ct.Statements` may import only specification modules.
-/
